    "detailed_description": "Explore the grand Arronian Empire and the isles that are before you. Embark on the mystery that has risen a titan of old, that threatens to sunder the world bringing in a new era of shadow. You have been given the chance to uncover the secrets hidden beneath the earth and with your new found power defend the world from darkness...or so it would seem.<br><br>Tiny World is an adventure RPG style game set from the Birds Eye view point. Follow along the journey of <strong>Tinn</strong> and with him uncover dangers beneath.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> FEATURES: </h2> <br><strong>1. </strong> 8 Dungeons <br><strong>2. </strong> 4 World Raids<br><strong>3. </strong> Unique Story lines <br><strong>4. </strong> Reputation Based Rewards ( End Game Progression, Reputation increases through Raids and Questing)<br><strong>5. </strong> Side View Combat Style",
